/E (Improving mental health involves prioritizing self-care, setting healthy boundaries, and maintaining a balanced work-life routine. Regular exercise, sufficient sleep, mindfulness practices, and open communication with supportive friends, family, or professionals can reduce stress and build resilience. Seeking help early and creating a positive environment at work and home further strengthens emotional well-being.)
